 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Ryota Killed His Brother"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "良太は弟を殺した"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Ryota wa Ototo wo Koroshita"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "When their mother dies, junior high school student Ryota takes care of his toddler brother Chika and their home. Overwhelmed by all the work, he begins neglecting himself. Without any time to himself, Ryota comes to resent his little brother and soon the resentment turns into murderous thoughts. Little by little the pressures of childrearing make Ryota lose his mind. But is Ryota truly the issue? Or...",
   "ja": "亡き母に代わって2歳の弟「愛（ちか）」の育児を任されてる中学2年生の「良太」。友人と遊ぶ暇もなく、言うことを聞かない弟に振り回される毎日。弟さえいなければ――。そんな考えが頭を過る時、遂に良太の中で「殺意」が顔を覗かせる…。　一線を越える夜、壊れゆくのは良太か、それとも――。"
  },
